## Anti-Patterns to Prevent

❌ **Game Logic in Rendering**: Keep rendering pure, no game state modification
❌ **Loading During Render**: Load assets during initialization, not render loop
❌ **No Viewport Culling**: Always check if objects are in viewport before rendering
❌ **Creating Surfaces Each Frame**: Cache and reuse surfaces
❌ **Unbounded Sprite Lists**: Clear renderable lists after each frame
❌ **Synchronous Asset Loading**: Load assets async where possible

## Success Metrics

- Consistent 60 FPS with 100+ entities on screen
- < 16ms frame time (p95)
- Sprite cache hit rate > 95%
- Zero game logic in rendering code
- Clean separation: rendering never modifies game state
